id=fold3-fingerprint-fix
name=Fold3 fingerprint active-group keeper
version=v2
versionCode=2
author=jason
description=Samsung fingerprint HAL loses its active user after boot / HAL or rild restarts; the framework then drops the enrollment at boot. Re-send setActiveGroup(0, /data/vendor_de/0/fpdata) as soon as the HAL starts and after every restart.
